{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2022-07-25 17:27:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK® CANADA ANNOUNCES FINAL JULY CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES® PREMIUM MONEY MARKET ETF', 'text': 'TORONTO, JULY 25, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BLACKROCK ASSET MANAGEMENT CANADA LIMITED (“BLACKROCK CANADA”), AN INDIRECT, WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF BLACKROCK, INC. (NYSE: BLK), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE FINAL JULY 2022 CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES PREMIUM MONEY MARKET ETF. UNITHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JULY 26, 2022 WILL RECEIVE CASH DISTRIBUTIONS PAYABLE ON JULY 29, 2022.'}